{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15748","headline":"酬崔峒见寄 · 司空曙","name":"酬崔峒见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"趋陪禁掖雁行随，迁放江潭鹤发垂。\n素浪遥疑太液水，青枫忽似万年枝。\n嵩南春遍愁魂梦，壶口云深隔路岐。\n共望汉朝多沛泽，苍蝇早晚得先知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}